[@1]
<h2>~gPage of Thunder</h2>
<p>Milord I need help here!!

[@2]
<p>~I~lYou wonder how the Page got himself into this mess...and how you are going to survive this ordeal...
<p>~N~.I shall help you as soon as I can!

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Beginnings</h2>
<i>"There is power in numbers"<br>
--Book of Nimbus</i>  
<p>Your small clan has drifted into an intense battle!  You have been quick in defending your island and have launched an attack on the Adminstrator of Wind who has your ally, the Page of Thunder, as his prisoner.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
Congratulations! You have made new allies and are victorious in this battle.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Dark2

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Page of Thunder has died</h2>
<p>Since you were not able to save your ally your new alliance was quickly terminated.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai5TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Im under attack!

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Perhaps I have over estimated you.......

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Duke of Thunder has died!</h2>
<p>
After the Duke of Thunder died the Knight of Wind dispatchs you for your weakness in battle.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai6TempleDead]
<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
That was easy enough.

[ai7TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Prove your worth and assist in my defence.

[ai7PriestCaptured]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>
I have should not have relied on your battle skills...

[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Knight of Wind has died!</h2>
<p>
The Duke of Thunder was not happy about his friend death.  He was however happy to kill you to avenge his commrade's death.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai8TempleDead]
<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
You are a good fighter.....let us join together and destroy these weakings.

$Button=Accept Alliance,DoNothing,0

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Your alliance with the Duke and Knight was ill fated...They survived you did not.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]


